From: Yashwanth &lt;yashwanthrajdj33@gmail.com&gt;
Date: Fri, Dec 19, 2025 at 6:54=E2=80=AFPM
Subject: Leave Request for internals , as well as work from home on
Saturday (Tommorow)
To: &lt;hretherxinnovations@gmail.com&gt;


Dear Sir/Madam,
I hope this message finds you well.
I would like to inform you that I have my internal examinations scheduled
from Monday to Wednesday. Hence, I kindly request leave for the mentioned
days.

Additionally, I would like to request Work From Home for tomorrow
(Saturday) so that I can effectively focus on my assigned work at EtherX
Innovations Pvt Ltd while also preparing for my examinations from home.

I assure you that I will stay available online and ensure all
responsibilities are managed without any disruption.

Thank you for your understanding and support.

Sincerely,
Yashwanth Raj
EtherX Innovations Pvt Ltd

--000000000000947bce0659c6cf7d
